---
source: Applied Kitchen
serves: 6
total time: 1 hour
tags:
  - side
  - potatoes
  - applied-kitchen
---

Preheat oven to 350°F.

Thinly slice @Yukon gold potatoes{24%oz} and place them in a #mixing bowl{}.

Add grated @Parmesan cheese{6%oz}, @heavy cream{12%oz}, @salt{}, and @pepper{} to the bowl with the potatoes. Stir until all the ingredients are well combined and the potatoes are evenly coated.

Grease a #casserole dish{} with @butter{} or oil to prevent sticking.

Layer the sliced potatoes evenly in the greased casserole dish.

Cover the casserole dish with #aluminum foil{}. Bake in the preheated oven for ~{60%minutes}.

After 60 minutes, remove the foil and continue baking for an additional 15 to ~{20%minutes}, or until the top is golden brown and the potatoes are tender.
